            ],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><img src=\"b2963790-7e69-4640-ba5a-716e3131299b\" visible-if=\"always\" /><p>I programmi intelligenti usano i <strong>booleani</strong> per decidere se <em>eseguire</em> righe di codice o <em>saltarle</em>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "If statement",
            "id": 126715,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come possiamo scrivere codice che si adatta a situazioni diverse? Usando l'<strong>istruzione if</strong>.</p><p>Usiamo la parola chiave <code>if</code> per un'istruzione if.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"2\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>if</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "If statement",
            "id": 126716,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>L'istruzione if <em>esegue il codice</em> solo se il valore booleano su cui si basa è <code>true</code>. È come dire: <em>se</em> qualcosa è vero, <em>allora</em> fai questo.</p><p><code>\"Hello!\"</code> verrà visualizzato nella console se impostiamo il valore booleano su <code>true</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "If statement",
            "id": 126717,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ma cosa succede se vogliamo <em>saltare</em> del codice? Invece usiamo <code>false</code>.</p><p>Impostando il valore su <code>false</code>, eviteremo di visualizzare <code>\"Hello!\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"8\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Conditions",
            "id": 126718,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Valori come <code>true</code> sono chiamati <strong>condizioni</strong>. Le istruzioni che dipendono dalle condizioni sono chiamate <strong>condizionali</strong>.</p><p>Le condizioni <em>decidono</em> se il codice viene eseguito o saltato.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello there&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;condition&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello there\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
