        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Code block ",
            "id": 126727,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>  Le istruzioni <code>if</code> non decidono se saltare o eseguire l'<em>intero</em> codice. Prendono decisioni solo su un <em>pezzo di codice</em>.</p><p>Questo pezzo di codice si chiama <strong>blocco di codice</strong>. Lo scriviamo tra parentesi graffe <code>{}</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;I'm a code block!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"9\" /><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"I'm a code block!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>{</code>, seguito da <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Expand code block",
            "id": 126728,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un blocco di codice può contenere più di una sola riga. Possiamo aggiungere tutte le righe che vogliamo.</p><p>Usa <code>print()</code> per aggiungere un'altra riga all'inizio.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Look at me!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;I'm a code block&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"30\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Look at me!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"I'm a code block\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>print</code>, seguito da <code>\"Look at me!\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "True Variable",
            "id": 126729,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Invece di usare il booleano <code>true</code>, possiamo salvarlo in una variabile e usare quella come condizione.</p><p>Crea la variabile <code>greet</code> e impostala su <code>true</code>. Poi usa <code>greet</code> come condizione per l'istruzione if.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greet = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greet {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"9\" /><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>greet</code>, seguito da <code>true</code> e infine <code>greet</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "False variable",
            "id": 126730,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usare una variabile impostata su <code>false</code> ci permette di <em>saltare</em> il blocco di codice.</p><p>Imposta <code>greet</code> su <code>false</code> per evitare di stampare <code>Hello!</code> nell'output.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greet = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greet {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"17\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
